  "notes": [
    "Maximums and minimums are per every 1,000 points unless otherwise stated (p. 182). The builder applies them as written, which is right for armies up to 1,000 points; scale them up yourself for larger armies.",
    "The Italian stat table has no regimental artillery battery, so it uses the French one (p. 154). The Infantry Brigade box prices it at 11 points, the Guard box at 19; the builder uses 19, as everywhere else in the book.",
    "The book gives no Italian half-battery stat lines, so the half batteries use the French ones (p. 154), at the points the Italian list gives (Foot 19, Horse 22)."
  ],
